# Clinical Token GitHub SSH

For Clinical Token GitHub repositories, use the Clinical Token GitHub SSH identity, not the GitLab key.

- Preferred SSH host alias: `github-clinicaltoken`
- SSH key: `~/.ssh/id_rsa_github_joe_clinical_token`
- Example clone URL: `git@github-clinicaltoken:clinical-token/<repo>.git`

Do not use `~/.ssh/id_rsa_joe_xing_ai_gitlab` for GitHub Clinical Token repos.
